    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa98f980_af2303a6",
        "filename": "keystone/common/cache/_memcache_pool.py",
        "patchSetId": 19
      },
      "lineNbr": 75,
      "author": {
        "id": 7725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-09-17T00:54:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good question. I don\u0027t think you can continue to wait. We would either have to fail or proceed without a cache. On second thought you could have a busy loop that will wait for X seconds, then log \u0027still waiting\u0027 and wait some more.",
      "parentUuid": "fa98f980_3453ea3a",
      "revId": "db0de93809561fc1f647d4f5c9d53ddd16d18478",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa98f980_c6b754f4",
        "filename": "keystone/common/cache/_memcache_pool.py",
        "patchSetId": 19
      },
      "lineNbr": 81,
      "author": {
        "id": 7725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-09-16T21:03:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s probably not a big deal, but by the time we get here it\u0027s possible that we have more than _maxsize. Probably not many more.",
      "revId": "db0de93809561fc1f647d4f5c9d53ddd16d18478",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa98f980_54486e8a",
        "filename": "keystone/common/cache/_memcache_pool.py",
        "patchSetId": 19
      },
      "lineNbr": 81,
      "author": {
        "id": 2903
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-09-16T21:13:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we\u0027re mostly ok here. We might leak a little over the top, but we\u0027re still talking coroutines in eventlet and we should be mostly safe on that front since the coroutine *probably* wont yield in this creation loop.",
      "parentUuid": "fa98f980_c6b754f4",
      "revId": "db0de93809561fc1f647d4f5c9d53ddd16d18478",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa98f980_af7143aa",
        "filename": "keystone/common/cache/_memcache_pool.py",
